{
	"name": "Unbound Elements",
	"type": "maneuver",
	"img": "icons/magic/symbols/elements-air-earth-fire-water.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>You call upon the elements to avoid being trapped and to move freely. You gain the following benefits based on your chosen element:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Water:</strong> You are unaffected by difficult terrain and can move through hostile creatures’ spaces freely. Your movement does not provoke opportunity attacks.</p></li><li><p><strong>Earth:</strong> Gain a Burrow speed equal to your movement speed. You also gain Blindsense of 10ft.</p></li><li><p><strong>Fire:</strong> You may teleport a distance equal to your movement speed; this replaces your movement on your turn.</p></li><li><p><strong>Air:</strong> You gain a Fly speed equal to your movement speed. If you end your turn hovering, you gain 1 level of fatigue.</p></li></ul>",
